window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>The moment she told me no, I knew she was mine.</b></p> <p>I didn't come to her apartment planning to tie her to her bed and ravage her. A Russian arms dealer has no need for an innocent schoolteacher. I would have done what I came to do and left, but when she opened those gorgeous red lips and threatened to scream I knew she would be screaming long before I was finished with her.</p> <p>Screaming for me.</p> <p>I'm not just going to take her. I'm going to take over her entire world; where she lives, what she eats, where she works...her every breath will be under my control. Call it obsession. Call it depravity. I don't give a damn...as long as you call her mine.</p> <p><i>Sweet Depravity</i> is a dark romance stand-alone novel intended for mature audiences.</p>"; 
